<title>USA: Optical Coating CFO Markovich resigns.</title>
<headline>Optical Coating CFO Markovich resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Coating Laboratory Inc said Friday that Chief Financial Officer John Markovich had resigned to take a senior management position with Auto-By-Tel Corp, a private Internet company.</p>
<p>Markovich's resignation is effective January 10.</p>
<p>Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary Joseph Zils will assume Markovich's responsibilities on an interim basis, the company said.</p>
<p>Markovich had been chief financial officer since 1995.</p>
<p>Optical Coating manufactures optical thin film-coated components.</p>
</text>
